====Usage notes====
* In English, the unqualified term {{m|en||America}} typically refers to the United States of America as a [[synecdoche]], with {{m|en|American}} typically referring to people and things from that country. The sense of {{m|en||the Americas}} varies in commonness between regions in contemporary English, but is found in certain circumstances, such as in reference to the [[w:Organization of American States|Organization of American States]].

